[{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10121002_00_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10121002_00_0010","text":"生日……\n你今年几岁了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10121002_00_0020","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10121002_00_0030","text":"啊……\n那我换个问法"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10121002_00_0040","text":"——还是说，已经到该叫『大叔』的年纪了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10121002_00_0050","text":"呃、唔……\n无可奉告……"}]
